  "Nexus Interface": "Nexus-interface",
  "Show isolated concepts": "Losse concepten tonen",
  "The scope applies everywhere: metrics, simulations, scenarios, influence routes and exports all use only the network in scope.": "De analyse geldt overal: maten, simulaties, scenario's, invloedsroutes en exports gebruiken alleen het netwerk in de analyse.",
